### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 1: Register a new user
### Expected: 201 Created + JWT token
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john@devflow.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 2: Login with that user
### Expected: 200 OK + JWT token
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@devflow.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 3: Login with WRONG password
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@devflow.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 4: Register with invalid data
### Expected: 400 Bad Request + field errors
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 5: Register duplicate email
### Expected: 409 Conflict
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john@devflow.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### TEST 6: Get current user profile
### Paste your token from TEST 1 or 2 below
### Expected: 200 OK + user profile
### ═══════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE